---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';

const consoleUrl = import.meta.env.PUBLIC_CONSOLE_URL || 'http://localhost:3000/login';
const stages = [
  { number: '01', title: 'Detect', detail: 'Compare source reality with declared contracts.' },
  { number: '02', title: 'Contain', detail: 'Hold an exposed action before it reaches the target.' },
  { number: '03', title: 'Investigate', detail: 'Collect cited evidence and surface disagreement.' },
  { number: '04', title: 'Decide', detail: 'Bind a disposition to policy and human approval.' },
  { number: '05', title: 'Recover', detail: 'Perform one bounded release or compensation.' },
  { number: '06', title: 'Verify', detail: 'Read the business state before closing the case.' },
];
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Action Integrity — Evidence before action"
  description="A governed control layer for unreliable data, exposed business actions and verified recovery."
  current="product"
>
  <section class="hero">
    <div class="hero-grid wrap">
      <div class="hero-content">
        <div class="eyebrow">GOVERNED ACTION CONTROL <span class="hero-rule"></span> PUBLIC / 01</div>
        <h1>Stop bad data before it becomes a <em>bad business action.</em></h1>
        <p class="hero-lede">An evidence-led control room that catches unreliable inputs, contains exposed actions, and proves the customer state after recovery.</p>
        <div class="hero-actions">
          <a class="button" href={consoleUrl}>Open control room <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a>
          <a class="button ghost" href="/trust/">Examine the trust model <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a>
        </div>
        <div class="hero-footnote"><span class="pulse-dot" aria-hidden="true"></span> CONTROL BEFORE REASONING <span class="divider">/</span> VERIFICATION BEFORE CLOSURE</div>
      </div>
      <div class="control-panel" aria-label="Illustration of an action held after a semantic integrity signal">
        <div class="panel-top"><span>CONTROL TRACE <span class="panel-id">/ AIC-001</span></span><span class="panel-live"><i></i> REVIEW REQUIRED</span></div>
        <div class="panel-canvas">
          <div class="flow-row"><span class="flow-index">01 / SOURCE SIGNAL</span><span class="flow-value">BILLING · PLAN STATUS</span><span class="flow-mark warn">!</span></div>
          <div class="flow-connector"></div>
          <div class="flow-row"><span class="flow-index">02 / PROPOSED ACTION</span><span class="flow-value">REVOKE · SSO ACCESS</span><span class="flow-mark arrow">↓</span></div>
          <div class="flow-connector active"></div>
          <div class="hold-row"><span class="hold-icon">⊣</span><div><span class="hold-title">ACTION HELD</span><span class="hold-detail">Target state unchanged</span></div><span class="hold-tag">CONTAINED</span></div>
          <div class="panel-evidence"><span>DECISION BASIS</span><p>Observed value conflicts with the declared business meaning. The action waits for cited evidence and an accountable decision.</p></div>
        </div>
        <div class="panel-bottom"><span>DATA → DECISION → VERIFIED OUTCOME</span><span>CONTROL / 01</span></div>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="hero-bottom wrap"><span>01 / THE PROBLEM</span><span>SCROLL TO EXPLORE ↓</span></div>
  </section>

  <section class="problem section-pad" id="problem">
    <div class="wrap problem-grid">
      <div><span class="section-index">01 / THE FAILURE PATH</span><h2 class="section-heading">When a source changes meaning, automation can stay perfectly on schedule—and still be wrong.</h2></div>
      <div class="problem-copy"><p>A subscription feed reports a value the contract does not recognize. A downstream agent prepares to revoke a customer entitlement. A successful API call would only confirm delivery, not that the customer outcome is correct.</p><p>Action Integrity places a control boundary between the evidence and the write. The operator sees the exposed action, the conflicting source, the affected account and the path to a verified resolution.</p></div>
    </div>
    <div class="wrap comparison">
      <div class="comparison-side before"><span class="card-index">UNCONTROLLED PATH</span><p>Source drift <b>→</b> automated revoke <b>→</b> API 200</p><span class="comparison-result">CUSTOMER IMPACT UNKNOWN</span></div>
      <div class="comparison-side after"><span class="card-index">GOVERNED PATH</span><p>Source drift <b>→</b> hold <b>→</b> evidence <b>→</b> approval <b>→</b> verified state</p><span class="comparison-result">BUSINESS OUTCOME OBSERVED</span></div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="system section-pad" id="system">
    <div class="wrap">
      <div class="section-intro"><div><span class="section-index">02 / THE CONTROL LOOP</span><h2 class="section-heading">Six stages. One accountable record.</h2></div><p class="section-copy">Each stage leaves evidence for the next. The model can explain and recommend; deterministic controls own the decision to act.</p></div>
      <ol class="stage-grid">
        {stages.map((stage) => <li class="stage"><span class="step-num">{stage.number} <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></span><h3>{stage.title}</h3><p>{stage.detail}</p></li>)}
      </ol>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="principles section-pad">
    <div class="wrap principles-grid">
      <div class="principles-title"><span class="section-index">03 / OPERATING PRINCIPLES</span><h2 class="section-heading">Built around the moment a decision matters.</h2><a class="text-link" href="/trust/">Read the operating model <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></div>
      <div class="principle-list">
        <article><span>01</span><div><h3>Evidence before recommendation</h3><p>Source records, conflicts and freshness stay visible beside every conclusion.</p></div></article>
        <article><span>02</span><div><h3>Human accountability</h3><p>Approval is tied to the evidence and policy version the reviewer actually saw.</p></div></article>
        <article><span>03</span><div><h3>One writer, explicit uncertainty</h3><p>A lost target response becomes unknown until a read establishes the business state.</p></div></article>
        <article><span>04</span><div><h3>Closure requires proof</h3><p>Recovery is complete only when verification observes the expected target state.</p></div></article>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="final-cta">
    <div class="wrap final-grid"><div><span class="eyebrow">READY TO INSPECT THE CONTROL LOOP?</span><h2>See the action. Trace the evidence. Verify the outcome.</h2></div><a class="button" href={consoleUrl}>Open the control room <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .section-pad { padding: 88px 0; }
  .hero { min-height: min(800px, calc(100svh - 72px)); position: relative; overflow: hidden; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--steel); background: linear-gradient(90deg, transparent calc(50% - 1px), rgba(56,46,48,.32) 50%, transparent calc(50% + 1px)), repeating-linear-gradient(0deg, transparent 0 79px, rgba(56,46,48,.18) 80px), repeating-linear-gradient(90deg, transparent 0 79px, rgba(56,46,48,.15) 80px), var(--carbon); }
  .hero::before { content: ''; position: absolute; left: 0; top: 0; bottom: 0; width: 3px; background: var(--signal); }
  .hero-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1.15fr) minmax(420px, .85fr); gap: 48px; min-height: 620px; align-items: center; }
  .hero-content { padding: 58px 0 70px; }
  .hero-rule { width: 30px; height: 1px; background: var(--steel); }
  h1 { font-size: clamp(42px, 4.3vw, 60px); line-height: 1.07; letter-spacing: -.05em; font-weight: 500; margin: 24px 0 20px; max-width: 700px; }
  h1 em { color: var(--signal); font-style: normal; }
  .hero-lede { max-width: 560px; color: var(--muted); line-height: 1.65; font-size: 18px; }
  .hero-actions { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 12px; margin-top: 38px; }
  .hero-footnote { display: flex; align-items: center; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 10px; color: var(--slate); font: 10px var(--font-mono); margin-top: 48px; letter-spacing: 0; }
  .pulse-dot { width: 6px; height: 6px; background: var(--success); }
  .divider { color: var(--steel); }
  .control-panel { align-self: center; border: 1px solid var(--steel); background: rgba(21,14,15,.98); box-shadow: 22px 22px 0 rgba(0,0,0,.3); }
  .panel-top, .panel-bottom { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; gap: 12px; padding: 17px 20px; font: 10px var(--font-mono); letter-spacing: 0; }
  .panel-top { border-bottom: 1px solid var(--steel); }
  .panel-bottom { color: var(--slate); border-top: 1px solid var(--steel); }
  .panel-id { color: var(--slate); }
  .panel-live { display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 7px; color: var(--warning); }
  .panel-live i { display: inline-block; width: 6px; height: 6px; background: var(--warning); }
  .panel-canvas { padding: 30px 28px; }
  .flow-row { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr auto 23px; align-items: center; gap: 12px; padding: 16px; border: 1px solid var(--steel); background: #110a0b; }
  .flow-index, .flow-value, .flow-mark { font: 10px var(--font-mono); }
  .flow-index { color: var(--slate); }
  .flow-value { color: var(--chalk); }
  .flow-mark { display: grid; place-items: center; border: 1px solid var(--steel); height: 23px; }
  .flow-mark.warn { color: var(--warning); }
  .flow-mark.arrow { color: var(--signal); }
  .flow-connector { height: 24px; width: 1px; background: var(--steel); margin-left: 32px; }
  .flow-connector.active { background: var(--signal); }
  .hold-row { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 15px; padding: 18px; border: 1px solid var(--signal); background: #230c10; }
  .hold-icon { display: grid; place-items: center; width: 31px; height: 31px; border: 1px solid var(--signal); color: var(--signal); font-size: 24px; }
  .hold-row div { display: grid; gap: 4px; }
  .hold-title { font: 12px var(--font-mono); letter-spacing: 0; }
  .hold-detail { color: var(--muted); font-size: 12px; }
  .hold-tag { margin-left: auto; color: var(--signal); font: 9px var(--font-mono); }
  .panel-evidence { margin-top: 28px; padding-top: 19px; border-top: 1px solid var(--steel); }
  .panel-evidence span { color: var(--signal); font: 10px var(--font-mono); }
  .panel-evidence p { color: var(--muted); line-height: 1.6; font-size: 13px; margin: 12px 0 0; }
  .hero-bottom { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; border-top: 1px solid var(--steel); padding: 20px 0; color: var(--slate); font: 10px var(--font-mono); }
  .problem { background: var(--graphite); }
  .problem-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1.15fr .85fr; gap: 64px; }
  .problem-copy { padding-top: 24px; color: var(--muted); line-height: 1.7; font-size: 16px; }
  .problem-copy p:first-child { margin-top: 0; color: var(--chalk); }
  .comparison { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; margin-top: 62px; border: 1px solid var(--steel); }
  .comparison-side { padding: 30px; min-height: 185px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; }
  .comparison-side + .comparison-side { border-left: 1px solid var(--steel); }
  .card-index { color: var(--slate); font-size: 11px; }
  .comparison-side p { font-size: 20px; line-height: 1.4; margin: 21px 0; }
  .comparison-side b { font-weight: 400; color: var(--signal); }
  .comparison-result { margin-top: auto; color: var(--warning); font: 10px var(--font-mono); }
  .comparison-side.after { background: #170d0f; }
  .comparison-side.after .comparison-result { color: var(--success); }
  .section-intro { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: end; gap: 48px; margin-bottom: 40px; }
  .section-intro .section-copy { max-width: 390px; margin: 0; }
  .stage-grid { list-style: none; display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr); margin: 0; padding: 0; border-top: 1px solid var(--steel); border-left: 1px solid var(--steel); }
  .stage { min-height: 200px; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--steel); border-right: 1px solid var(--steel); padding: 24px; transition: background .2s; }
  .stage:hover { background: var(--graphite); }
  .step-num { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; color: var(--signal); font-size: 11px; }
  .stage h3 { font-size: 22px; font-weight: 500; margin: 30px 0 10px; }
  .stage p { max-width: 275px; color: var(--muted); line-height: 1.55; font-size: 14px; margin: 0; }
  .principles { background: var(--graphite); border-block: 1px solid var(--steel); }
  .principles-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: .8fr 1.2fr; gap: 64px; }
  .text-link { display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 35px; margin-top: 32px; padding-bottom: 10px; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--signal); font-size: 14px; }
  .text-link span { color: var(--signal); }
  .principle-list { border-top: 1px solid var(--steel); }
  .principle-list article { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 48px 1fr; gap: 20px; padding: 26px 0; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--steel); }
  .principle-list article > span { color: var(--signal); font: 11px var(--font-mono); padding-top: 4px; }
  .principle-list h3 { margin: 0; font-size: 18px; font-weight: 500; }
  .principle-list p { margin: 8px 0 0; color: var(--muted); line-height: 1.5; font-size: 14px; }
  .final-cta { padding: 85px 0; background: repeating-linear-gradient(90deg, transparent 0 119px, rgba(56,46,48,.22) 120px), var(--carbon); }
  .final-grid { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: end; gap: 40px; }
  .final-grid h2 { max-width: 710px; font-size: clamp(32px, 4vw, 46px); line-height: 1.13; font-weight: 500; letter-spacing: -.045em; margin: 20px 0 0; }
  .final-grid .button { white-space: nowrap; }
  @media (max-width: 1000px) { .hero-grid { grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr); gap: 0; padding-top: 30px; }.hero-content { min-width: 0; padding-bottom: 40px; }.control-panel { min-width: 0; margin-bottom: 60px; width: min(100%, 650px); }.problem-grid, .principles-grid { gap: 50px; } }
  @media (max-width: 720px) { .section-pad { padding: 75px 0; }.problem-grid, .principles-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 20px; }.comparison { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }.comparison-side + .comparison-side { border-left: 0; border-top: 1px solid var(--steel); }.section-intro { display: block; }.section-intro .section-copy { margin-top: 22px; }.stage-grid { grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr); }.final-grid { display: block; }.final-grid .button { margin-top: 30px; } }
  @media (max-width: 540px) { h1 { font-size: 44px; overflow-wrap: anywhere; }.hero-actions { display: grid; }.hero-footnote { margin-top: 40px; }.control-panel { box-shadow: none; }.panel-canvas { padding: 16px; }.flow-row { grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr) 23px; }.flow-index { grid-column: 1 / 2; }.flow-value { grid-column: 1 / 2; overflow-wrap: anywhere; }.flow-mark { grid-column: 2; grid-row: 1 / 3; }.hold-tag { display: none; }.stage-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }.stage { min-height: 185px; }.stage h3 { margin-top: 30px; } }
</style>
